model r7_g13
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.7, R7 (#146; G13, GAPS l.131): a result's register is the set of what it read, whatever order its cells were computed in: the pin on a that s[5] reads is listed under each line, whether s[5] or u, which reads it, is read first"

source card "T's card (invented)"

index ks = 1..5

input a: int

def s[k in ks]: int = a * k

def u: int = s[5] + a

ask t1: s[5], u with a = 3

ask t2: u, s[5] with a = 3

ask t3: u with a = 3

version v1
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = 2 "the card"
